  "publicWarnings": {
    "recovery-municipal-mcbride-2022-elected-officials": "The printed council combined total is 55,812.83 CAD, while its remuneration control 34,965.00 plus expense control 24,087.83 equals 59,052.83 CAD. Individual remuneration and known expenses agree with their separate printed controls. Combined totals are not used as remuneration; the published discrepancy remains unresolved. The officially linked 2022 original has an unsigned approval page with blank dates; adoption is not established by this original.",
    "recovery-municipal-mcbride-2022-employee-remuneration": "The officially linked 2022 original has an unsigned approval page with blank dates; adoption is not established by this original.",
    "recovery-municipal-mcbride-2025-employee-remuneration": "Only the complete employee schedule on physical page 43 is included: its heading and the report cover explicitly identify 2025. The adjacent council schedule on page 42 explicitly says 2024 and conflicts with the separate 2024 report; that council schedule is held for clarification and has not been relabelled or imported.",
    "recovery-municipal-sooke-2025-elected-officials": "Sooke 2025 prints council remuneration of 172,062 and council expenses of 26,266 on page 37, but carries 172,064 in both council remuneration and council expenses columns on page 38. Page 38 prints total remuneration 8,634,739 and expenses 282,537. These published controls are retained literally; the differences remain unresolved and no cells have been adjusted.",
    "recovery-municipal-sooke-2025-employee-remuneration": "Sooke 2025 prints council remuneration of 172,062 and council expenses of 26,266 on page 37, but carries 172,064 in both council remuneration and council expenses columns on page 38. Page 38 prints total remuneration 8,634,739 and expenses 282,537. These published controls are retained literally; the differences remain unresolved and no cells have been adjusted. Known individual sums differ from printed named controls: remuneration 6,874,288.00 CAD versus 6,874,287.00 CAD (residual +1.00); expenses 110,428.00 CAD versus 110,474.00 CAD (residual -46.00). Original row values remain literal; cause unresolved."
  },
